Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:d4ebcba36d271ea456188a258eee9a0bb59f2fb1
Cherrypick-From: https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:92cf2be8cb402c8c324eed46d20bddc4bee6bb58
